  "title": "Ben’s Diary — Going to the Hospital",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-06-24",
  "synopsis": "Ben writes about how he got a stomach ache from drinking too much cold water.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/450/0301b73b975156d0c2fc25cb32dd45c40f423a3a.mp3?1589791088",
  "series": {
