    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben’s Diary — Going to the Hospital",
      "",
      "Today my stomach hurt.",
      "Lili and I went to the hospital together.",
      "The doctor said my stomach hurt because I drank too much cold water.",
      "In America I also drank cold water, but my stomach didn’t hurt.",
      "Afterwards I understood that it is because the water I drank wasn’t clean.",
      "In China, you can’t directly drink the tap water. You must boil it before you drink.",
      "But I didn’t know, so I drank directly from the tap like in America, and got a stomach ache.",
